  "prompt": "Cho hình lăng trụ tam giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>.</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow></semantics></math>. Gọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>G</mi></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow></semantics></math> lần lượt là trọng tâm của hai tam giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.\n\t<ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li>Chứng minh rằng tứ giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>G</mi><mi>G</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là hình bình hành.</li><li>Chứng minh rằng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>G</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>.</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>G</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là hình lăng trụ.</li></ol>",
  "choices": [],
  "correct": null,
  "solution": "<div class=\"with-figure\"><div><ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li>Gọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>M</mi></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow></semantics></math> lần lượt là trung điểm của <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Vì <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là hình bình hành, nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>′</mi><mo>∥</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>′</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>′</mi><mo>∥</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>′</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow></semantics></math>. Do đó <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là hình bình hành.<br>Mặt khác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>G</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi>A</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>G</mi><mi>′</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Vậy <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>G</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>G</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>G</mi><mo>∥</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>G</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là hình bình hành.</li><li>Tương tự phần a) ta cũng có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>G</mi><mi>G</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là hình bình hành.<br>Vậy <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>G</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>.</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>G</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là hình lăng trụ.</li></ol></div><div class=\"side-figure\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/39c0daa864064aec367d3baab02f8b2fc259d6c5fe5e9771eae5101ba0e91cdc.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div></div>",
